# 9️⃣ LINEAR REGRESSION CONNECTION 🔥

Suppose:

```text
Study hours = 5
Attendance = 90
```

Our model has weights:

```text
Study hours weight = 10
Attendance weight = 0.5
```

Then:

$$
prediction =
5(10)+90(0.5)
$$

$$
=50+45
$$

$$
=95
$$

This is essentially a dot product.

```text
Features
   ↓
[5, 90]

Weights
   ↓
[10, 0.5]

     ↓ DOT PRODUCT

Prediction
   ↓
95
```

That's one reason linear algebra is fundamental to ML.

