# 1️⃣5️⃣ L1 VS L2 NORMS

## L1 norm

$$
||x||_1 = |x_1|+|x_2|+\cdots
$$

Example:

```text
x = [3,-4]
```

$$
L1=|3|+|-4|=7
$$

---

## L2 norm

$$
||x||_2=
\sqrt{x_1^2+x_2^2+\cdots}
$$

For:

```text
[3,-4]
```

$$
L2=5
$$

These later become important in **regularization**.

